{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Good Leadership"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Group Development"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Express duty, advice, willingness, or intention to do something in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le06ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "development"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of working on something to make it successful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bruce Tuckman has determined the five phases of group development \u2014 forming, storming, norming, performing and adjourning. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when talking about groups. "}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sequential"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "happening in a set order"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The phases are not sequential, because groups can cycle through the phases."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to arise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to begin be caused or started by a situation "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Questions arise among the group."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "preconceived"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "formed before you have enough knowledge or experience"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Members are willing to change their preconceived ideas or opinions on the basis of facts presented by other members. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "clique"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small group of people who do not want other people to join them  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Leadership is shared, and cliques dissolve."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to solicit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask someone for help or information"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  It has been agreed to share feelings and ideas, solicit and give feedback to one another, and explore actions related to the task. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dynamically"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "continuously \u200bchanging or \u200bdeveloping"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Their roles dynamically adjust to the changing needs of the group and individuals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "emphasis"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "special attention or importance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is decided to support each other when solving problems and an put an emphasis on achievement. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disengagement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the process of withdrawing from involvement in a particular group"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It involves disengagement from relationships."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le06ob09aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Passive -ing Forms "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use passive -ing forms (<span class=\"italic\">being</span> + -<span class=\"italic\">ed</span>, <span class=\"italic\">having been</span> + -<span class=\"italic\">ed</span>) as participles with the meaning of <span class=\"italic\">because</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Being paid</span> monthly, I find it hard to pay all my bills on time.</span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Having been moved</span> around as a child, she has no desire to do the same as an adult.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at some other examples from the text. Notice the structure of the sentences."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being wanted to be accepted, members will gather information about the similarities and differences among them. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Having been characterized by competition and conflict, the next stage is known as storming. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Being given the opportunity, members say their personal goodbyes to each other. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Report Verbs with Impersonal Passive Constructions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you want to report a fact or belief, you can use a variety of ways to construct your ideas. When you do not want to mention the source of the information, you can use a passive structure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the structure <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">It + passive verb + to-infinitive</span></span>. You can only use this pattern with the verbs <span class=\"italic\">agree</span>,<span class=\"italic\"> decide </span>and <span class=\"italic\">propose</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">It was agreed to promote</span> the whole team at once.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "If necessary, you can express the agent."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">It was agreed <span class=\"strong\">by the managers</span> to promote the whole team at once.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It was said by Tuckman that team members will look to the team leader for guidance."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It has been agreed to share feelings and ideas, solicit and give feedback to one another, and explore actions related to the task. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The final stage, adjourning was proposed by Tuckman to involve the termination of tasks"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Watch a video on \u201cTuckman Stages of Group Development\u201d by Katy Jones online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Get into groups of three or four."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a similar video explaining Tuckman's five stages of development on a phone or other video recording device. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Next, write about your experience working in the group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "How did your group experience relate to the different stages of group development?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write your experience in a 200-word document."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I collaborate with a group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I plan and make a video with group members."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I reflect on my experience working in the group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about my experience."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss reasons and results of an event or action related to work and jobs."}, {"type": "Learning